{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Heirs of Heaven</i> is a gripping story-driven action-adventure set in a post-apocalyptic world.\u00a0 <br>Play as Mate, a young survivor on a mission to find his missing father and uncover the cure for a deadly virus.<br><br><strong>The Hilltop Haven:</strong> Mate\u2019s mountain refuge is a fragile sanctuary. But secrets linger, and Mate must choose between safety and a daring escape into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/e375f34c9b834491aeca647a0c44dc22.poster.avif?t=1759703390\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/e375f34c9b834491aeca647a0c44dc22.webm?t=1759703390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/e375f34c9b834491aeca647a0c44dc22.mp4?t=1759703390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>  <br> <strong>Survival Requires Courage:</strong> Armed with limited resources, Mate faces the wilderness head-on, hunting to survive and learning to adapt\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/e1e0e118ce45178c5384b98a0639d870.poster.avif?t=1759703390\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/e1e0e118ce45178c5384b98a0639d870.webm?t=1759703390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/e1e0e118ce45178c5384b98a0639d870.mp4?t=1759703390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Prepare for Danger:</strong> Every moment counts. Scavenge for weapons, manage your inventory, and arm yourself for the threats ahead<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/0a99ac85df8f9806da1042d378efcf61.poster.avif?t=1759703390\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/0a99ac85df8f9806da1042d378efcf61.webm?t=1759703390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/0a99ac85df8f9806da1042d378efcf61.mp4?t=1759703390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Stealth or Strength:</strong> Whether you strike from the shadows or engage head-on, the choice is yours. Strategy and precision are key to survival.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/9e3c8025a538906e7cd87693be184953.poster.avif?t=1759703390\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/9e3c8025a538906e7cd87693be184953.webm?t=1759703390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/9e3c8025a538906e7cd87693be184953.mp4?t=1759703390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Hope Amid the Ruins:</strong> Every step brings Mate closer to the truth. Explore stunning environments and forge unlikely alliances in a quest filled with danger, hope, and sacrifice.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/5fd6900b64c5d86852681ebc82ed49ae.poster.avif?t=1759703390\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/5fd6900b64c5d86852681ebc82ed49ae.webm?t=1759703390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/extras/5fd6900b64c5d86852681ebc82ed49ae.mp4?t=1759703390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in tense combat</strong> with zombies, mutants, and rogue soldiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a ruined world</strong>, from mountain hideouts to a crumbling city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge and craft</strong> to survive the harsh environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face powerful enemies</strong>, including terrifying bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience an emotional journey</strong> filled with danger, hope, and sacrifice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth and save humanity? The fight for survival begins now.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3404040?t=1759703390","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3404040?t=1759703390","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/99b6149f795e3aef800c6c01ecea22c6fbf2eeb8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759703390","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/99b6149f795e3aef800c6c01ecea22c6fbf2eeb8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759703390","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3446720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Heirs of Heaven</i> is a gripping story-driven action-adventure set in a post-apocalyptic world.\u00a0 <br>Play as Mate, a young survivor on a missio